  "restore-lost-cards-migration-description": "Ɛhwehwɛ na ɛsan de kaad ne din a wɔahyehyɛ a enni swimlaneId anaa listId no ba. Ɛyɛ adwuma kwan a wɔfrɛ no 'Lost Cards' de ma wohu nneɛma a ayera no nyinaa bio.",
  "restore-all-archived-migration": "San fa nea ɛwɔ adekorabea nyinaa ba",
  "restore-all-archived-migration-description": "San fa adwuma akwan, din a wɔahyehyɛ ne kaad a ɛwɔ adekorabea nyinaa ba. Ɛno ankasa siesie swimlaneId anaa listId biara a ayera na nneɛma no apue.",
