  "fix-all-file-urls-migration-description": "Ɛyɛ fael a wɔde aka bɔɔd yi ho no URL nyinaa foforo ma ɛde akorabea a ɛfata di dwuma, na ɛsiesie fael nkitahodi a asɛe.",
