  "migrations-admin-only": "Bɔɔd sohwɛfo nkutoo na wobetumi de nsɛm akɔ nhyehyɛe foforo mu",
  "migrations-description": "Hwɛ na siesie bɔɔd yi nsɛm mu pɛyɛ. Wubetumi ayɛ nsɛm a wɔde kɔ nhyehyɛe foforo mu no biara mmiako mmiako.",
  "no-issues-found": "Wɔanhu ɔhaw biara",
  "run-migration": "Fa nsɛm no kɔ baabi foforo",
  "run-comprehensive-migration-confirm": "Eyi bɛyɛ nsɛm a wɔde kɔ nhyehyɛe foforo mu no nyinaa de ahwɛ na asiesie bɔɔd nsɛm no mu pɛyɛ. Ebetumi agye bere kakra. Toa so?",
  "run-delete-duplicate-empty-lists-migration-confirm": "Eyi bedi kan adan din a wɔahyehyɛ a wɔkyɛ no ayɛ adwuma kwan biara de, na afei apopa nea emu da hɔ a din foforo a wɔahyehyɛ a ɛwɔ asɛmti koro no ara kura kaad no. Nea emu da hɔ a ɛho nhia ampa no nkutoo na wobeyi afi hɔ. Toa so?",
  "run-restore-lost-cards-migration-confirm": "Eyi bɛyɛ adwuma kwan a wɔfrɛ no 'Lost Cards' na asan de kaad ne din a wɔahyehyɛ a enni swimlaneId anaa listId no nyinaa aba. Eyi ka nneɛma a wɔmfa nkɔɔ adekorabea no nkutoo. Toa so?",
  "run-restore-all-archived-migration-confirm": "Eyi bɛsan de adwuma akwan, din a wɔahyehyɛ ne kaad a ɛwɔ adekorabea no NYINAA aba, ama wɔahu bio. Afiri no ankasa besiesie nneɛma biara a enni ID no. Ɛnyɛ mmerɛw sɛ wobɛsan ayi eyi. Toa so?",
  "run-fix-missing-lists-migration-confirm": "Eyi behu na asiesie din a wɔahyehyɛ a enni hɔ anaa asɛe wɔ bɔɔd nhyehyɛe no mu. Toa so?",
  "run-fix-avatar-urls-migration-confirm": "Eyi bɛsesa bɔɔd no so nnipa mfonini URL ahorow ama ɛde akorabea nhyehyɛe a ɛfata adi dwuma. Toa so?",
  "run-fix-all-file-urls-migration-confirm": "Eyi bɛsesa fael a wɔde abata bɔɔd yi ho nyinaa URL ahorow ama ɛde akorabea nhyehyɛe a ɛfata adi dwuma. Toa so?",
