  "password-length-login-count": "Mpɛn dodow a wɔkɔɔ mu",
  "password-length-no-results": "Akontaa biara nni ha.",
  "password-length-report-desc": "Akontaa a wɔde ahintasɛm a ɛyɛ tiaa sen tenten a ɛsɛ no na ɛkɔɔ mu. Brawsa no nko ara na enim ahintasɛm tenten, enti ɛbɔ amanneɛ fa tiaa bi ho wɔ wɔkɔ mu akyi; ahintasɛm no ne ne tenten mfi brawsa no mu da. Wɔasiesie kyerɛ bere a wɔsesaa akontaa no ahintasɛm - akontaa a ɛsan de ahintasɛm tiaa kɔ mu no, wɔsan kyerɛ sɛ ɛyɛ tiaa dodo.",
  "password-length-saved": "Wɔasie.",
  "password-min-length": "Ahintasɛm tenten a ɛsɛ sɛ ɛyɛ kakraa koraa",
  "password-min-length-description": "Wɔkyerɛw nkɔ-mu a wɔde ahintasɛm tiaa yɛe no wɔ ase ha. Wɔmpo nkɔ-mu da esiane eyi nti.",
  "password-min-length-enforce": "Hyɛ tenten kakraa koraa no so",
  "password-min-length-enforce-description": "Wɔpo ahintasɛm foforo a ɛyɛ tiaa, na akontaa a ɛde ahintasɛm tiaa kɔ mu no, ɛsɛ sɛ ɛsesa no ansa na ayɛ biribi foforo. Sɛ wosesa a, ɛyi akontaa no nhyiamu biara fi mu. LDAP, OAuth2, OIDC, SAML, CAS ne Sandstorm ahintasɛm yɛ wɔn mamfo dea, na wɔnhwɛ mu.",
  "password-change-required-text": "Saa site yi hwehwɛ seesei sɛ ahintasɛm nkyerɛwde dodow yɛ __min__ anaa ɛboro saa, na wo dea yɛ tiaa. Paw nea ɛware kakra na toa so. Afei wobeyi wo akontaa nhyiamu biara afi mu, na wode ahintasɛm foforo no bɛsan akɔ mu.",
  "date-format-for-everyone": "Da nkyerɛw nhyehyɛe ma obiara",
  "calendar-system": "Kalɛnna nhyehyɛeɛ (da a wɔkyerɛ)",
  "show-unread-changes": "Hyɛ kaad a wɔasesa wɔn fi bere a mebuee wɔn akyiri no agyiraeɛ",
  "show-unread-changes-desc": "Kaad a ne din, ne nkyerɛmu, ne nna, ne agyiraeɛ, n'amanfoɔ, ne nhwɛsoɔ din, nneɛma a wɔde aka ho anaa nsɛm a wɔka ho asesa wɔ bere a wobuee no akyiri no nya ano bruu wɔ ne kaad ketewa so, kosi sɛ wobɛbue no.",
  "keep-title-tags": "Kora #nsɛnkyerɛnne ne @amanfoɔ wɔ kaad foforɔ asɛmti mu",
  "keep-title-tags-description": "Sɛ wopaw nsɛnkyerɛnne bi wɔ # anaa obi a ɔka amanfoɔ ho wɔ @ bere a worekyerɛw kaad foforɔ asɛmti a, kora saa nkyerɛwee no wɔ asɛmti no mu nso. Mmom: nsɛnkyerɛnne anaa onipa no besi nkyerɛwee no anan.",
  "show-focus-outline": "Kyerɛ ahwɛyie ntwerɛ",
  "keep-add-card-form-open": "Ma Fa kaad ka ho krataa no nkɔ so mmue wɔ kaad bi a wode aka ho akyi",
  "keep-add-card-form-open-description": "Bue: sɛ wode kaad aka ho a, krataa no kɔ so bue a ne din yɛ hwee ma kaad a edi hɔ. To mu: krataa no to mu bere a wode kaad no aka ho.",
  "title-bracket-label": "Dan [nsɛnkyerɛnne] a ɛwɔ kaad foforɔ asɛmti ahyɛaseɛ no nsɛnkyerɛnne",
  "title-bracket-label-description": "Sɛ kaad foforɔ asɛmti fi ase de [Nkyerɛwee] na nkyerɛwee foforɔ di akyi a, Nkyerɛwee no bɛyɛ kaad no nsɛnkyerɛnne (wɔbɛyɛ no sɛ bɔɔd no nni nsɛnkyerɛnne a ne din saa) na wɔayi afi asɛmti no mu. Mmom: asɛmti no tena sɛdeɛ ɛte.",
  "submit-on-enter": "Fa Enter sie nsakrae",
